Faux_Pseudo wrote:

> What tricks can be used to actually survive the room.  I don't want to
> ditch it by digging my way out of there.  I want to clear it.

Stand on the down stairs (which may entail digging down and going back
up). Don't get burdened.

Write the E-word with a wand of fire, digging or lightning, or the
Magicbane, on the down stairs in the big room as well as the up stairs in
the room below.

Fight.

Whenever your HP drop to a scary level (that's below 10 for me; mileage
may vary) go down and heal up.

When you've thinned out the monsters in the big room to something
acceptable, you can make little forays to pick up items. Most of the
items will be brought to you by monsters anyway. Beware of wands of
lightning, cold, death, etcetera that may be lying around: it's a good
idea to have reflection.

> Free action?  Scare monster?  Earth?  confusion/charm?  Lots of pets?
